:Box
  |~~ A parcel as the courier measures it.
      ::part~(/0) the length, in centimetres
      ::part~(/1) the width, in centimetres
      ::part~(/2) the height, in centimetres
      ::part~(/3) the weight of what is inside, in kilograms
  ~~|
  ::spec~()
:Box/volume
  |~~ The space inside, in cubic centimetres. ~~|
  ::verb~(take 3 | reduce 1 ~(mul))
:Box/density
  |~~ Kilograms per cubic centimetre. ~~|
  ::verb~(:v volume | /3 | div v)
:Box/empty
  |~~ The same box with nothing inside. ~~|
  ::verb~(payload | take 3 | append 0 | tag ::Box)
:Box/put
  |~~ The same box with a weight put inside instead of what was there.
      ::example~(::Box[1 2 3 4] | put 10)
  ~~|
  ::verb~(:weight ::number | payload | take 3 | append weight | tag ::Box)
